# ── Type mapping (split out of lower.gg) ─────────────────────────────
# Type-name <-> GIR/C-name mapping, AST/resolved type lowering, tuple
# registration, static-initializer registration, method/builtin return-
# type inference, resource-type classification, and the binop/cmpop
# opcode maps. Moved verbatim from lower.gg as part of the lower.gg
# module split (output-neutral pure function move).
